---
import LetterTitle from '../components/LetterTitle.astro';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { loadSite } from '../lib/site';

const { settings } = await loadSite();
const UPDATED = '22 October 2026';
const pricesUpdated = new Date(settings.pricesUpdatedAt).toLocaleDateString('en-GB', {
  day: 'numeric',
  month: 'long',
  year: 'numeric',
});
---

<Base
  title="Booking terms · Body Gallery Kasoa"
  description="Body Gallery's booking terms: confirmations, deposits, changes, late arrival, prices, your health and results."
  settings={settings}
>
  <section class="wrap pt-32 pb-24 md:pt-40 md:pb-32">
    <LetterTitle text="Terms" />
    <p class="mt-4 text-sm text-muted">Last updated {UPDATED}</p>

    <div class="prose mt-12 md:mt-16">
      <p>
        These terms cover bookings and treatments at {settings.businessName},{' '}
        {settings.address.locality}. By booking with us, you agree to them.
      </p>

      <h2>Booking</h2>
      <p>
        Your booking is confirmed when we reply on WhatsApp with your date and time. Advanced
        treatments are strictly by appointment.
      </p>

      <h2>Deposits</h2>
      <p>
        Some advanced treatments need a deposit to secure your appointment. We'll tell you the
        amount and how to pay before your visit, and confirm in writing how the deposit is handled
        if you change or cancel.
      </p>

      <h2>Changing or cancelling</h2>
      <p>
        If you need to change or cancel, please message us on WhatsApp as early as you can so we can
        offer the time to someone else.
      </p>

      <h2>Arriving late</h2>
      <p>
        If you're running late, let us know. We'll do our best to fit you in, but your treatment may
        be shorter so the next client isn't kept waiting.
      </p>

      <h2>Prices</h2>
      <p>
        Prices on this website are in Ghana cedis and were last updated on {pricesUpdated}. We
        confirm the price of your treatment when you book. Prices for advanced treatments are given
        at your consultation, before any treatment starts.
      </p>

      <h2>Your health and suitability</h2>
      <p>
        Please tell us about any health conditions, medicines, allergies, pregnancy or recent
        treatments before your appointment. We may decline or postpone a treatment if it isn't safe
        or suitable for you.
      </p>

      <h2>Results</h2>
      <p>
        Results vary from person to person. We'll explain what's realistic for you, but we can't
        guarantee a particular result. Following the aftercare advice we give you helps you get the
        best result and lowers the risk of side effects.
      </p>

      <h2>Photos</h2>
      <p>
        We only use photos of you with your written consent. See our{' '}
        <a href="/privacy">privacy notice</a> for how to withdraw it.
      </p>

      <h2>This website</h2>
      <p>
        We work to keep this website accurate, but details can change. If anything on the website
        differs from what we confirm with you on WhatsApp, what we confirm on WhatsApp applies.
      </p>

      <h2>Law</h2>
      <p>These terms are governed by the laws of Ghana.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
